=== TDD RED: W8 vector dirs against HEAD (172aaaa) rtl/matvec_engine.sv + tb/tb_matvec.sv
=== HEAD RTL has no cfg_w8: SHAPE bit 29 does not exist, so a 64-byte beat is
=== parsed as 128 nibbles -> wrong y32 on EVERY row, and the row stream desyncs
